cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software or its data, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "AdaptiveQKE: Context-Aware Hybrid Key Exchange for TLS Channels"
abstract: >-
  A client-side, policy-driven mechanism that selects among ML-KEM and ECDH
  hybrid key-exchange groups before a TLS 1.3 handshake, based on measured
  round-trip time and endpoint resource limits, with the testbed and recorded
  measurements used to evaluate it.
